like a bug report or something that's a little bit more complex or even a feature request,

00:04:36.079 --> 00:04:39.839
it gets escalated to the engineering team. And I thought, well, you know,

00:04:39.839 --> 00:04:44.160
Cloud is really good at reading the code base and developing an understanding of how things work

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:53.440
and finding bugs. What if we could just point Cloud at all of the context that's coming in from

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:59.359
a Zendesk ticket? Because there'll be the whole backstory of what the issue was, sometimes a full

